 SET TALK OFF
 SET ECHO OFF
 SET ESCAPE OFF
 SET SYSMENU SAVE
 SET SYSMENU TO
 DEAC WINDOW ALL
 HIDE WINDOW ALL
 SET CENTURY ON
 SET DATE TO briti
 CLEA
 DEFI WINDOW vizualiz FROM 0, 0 TO 24, 79 SYSTEM COLOR ,,,,BG/N,W+/B,,,B/W 
 DEFI WINDOW fer_brow FROM INT((SROWS()-14)/2), INT((SCOLS()-72)/2) TO INT((SROWS()-14)/2)+13, INT((SCOLS()-72)/2)+71 NOFLOAT NOCLOSE SHADOW NOMINIMIZE COLOR SCHEME 7
 CLOS ALL
 USE SOLDURI
 COUN ALL TO nr
 IF nr=0
      CLOS ALL
      DO cc_sold
      CLOS ALL
      DO verific
      CLOS ALL
 ENDI
 CLOS ALL
 DO titlu
 DEFI MENU men_prg
