PROC _03i0sia0n
 HIDE MENU men_prg
 HIDE POPUP ALL
 HIDE WINDOW ALL
 CLEA
 CLOS ALL
 SELE 1
 USE GESTIUNI
 SELE 2
 USE TRANZACT
 SELE 1
 GOTO TOP
 DO WHILE  .NOT. EOF()
      SELE 2
      LOCA FOR cod_ges=A.cod
      IF  .NOT. FOUND()
           SELE 1
           DELE
      ENDI
      SELE 1
      SKIP 1
 ENDD
 SELE 1
 PACK
 CLOS ALL
 CLEA MEMO
 CLEA
 HIDE WINDOW ALL
 SHOW MENU men_prg
 CLEA
 DO titlu.prg
 RETU TO MASTER
